# This directory is reserved for screenshot and image assets.
# Place any annotated screenshots or visual evidence here.
# Supported formats: PNG, JPEG, WebP, SVG
#
# Naming convention:
#   page-{pagename}-{issue-id}.png     e.g. page-homepage-F001.png
#   annotation-{description}.png       e.g. annotation-missing-reviews.png
#   competitor-{name}-{feature}.png    e.g. competitor-namshi-reviews.png
